# The matrix moves LFO 1's SHAPE and SYM: LFO 2 (slow) sweeps SHAPE from SQUARE down through SAW, RAMP, TRI to
# SINE (a blend between neighbours, so it morphs), and SYM both ways; LFO 1 stays in -1..1 and the destinations
# are offered (GP 14 L1 SHAPE, GP 103 L1 SYM, GP 13 L1 RATE, GP 15 L2 RATE; MS 2 LFO2)
wait 300
setgp 14 4
setgp 13 90
setgp 15 20
setmatg 1 2 14 -100
setmatg 2 2 103 100
key 7 down
wait 500
expect msrc LFO1 -1.0 1.0
wait 700
expect msrc LFO1 -1.0 1.0
wait 900
expect msrc LFO1 -1.0 1.0
wait 1100
expect msrc LFO1 -1.0 1.0
key 7 up
wait 200
